        {
          "id": "the_collapsed_base_rate_reproduces_baseRateByAge_and_reaches_every_species_row",
          "description": "S13 and S14 against `baseRateByAge_1_2020`, the reference's own generator output, at both day types and all four fuel types. `emissionratebyage` carries polProcessID 101 alone, so only the 124 THC rate rows have a rate of their own; the self-join that carried that rate to the 520 species rows, `rtDay_rootRate`, is gone from the model and is not asserted; the species rows' own base rate is asserted to be exactly 0 (NMHC row 697). Its temperature factor is 1, so the root rate and the reference base rate are equal to the reference's own six significant figures. Electricity is rated at exactly zero and the row exists.",
